---
<DocsLayout title="Spacing and sizing" description="Spacing, dimensions, insets, gaps, and scroll offsets."><header><p class={classes.eyebrow}>Utility reference</p><h1 class={classes.title}>Spacing and sizing</h1><p class={classes.lead}>Spacing, dimensions, insets, gaps, and scroll offsets.</p></header><section class={classes.section}><h2 class={classes.heading}>Classes</h2><p class={classes.copy}>p-*, m-*, gap-*, space-x/y-*, w-*, h-*, min-w/h-*, max-w/h-*, inline-*, block-*, size-*, inset-*, start/end-*, scroll-m-*, scroll-p-*, and border-spacing-*.</p></section></DocsLayout>
